  "description": "Session viewer for the LLM gateway. Everything is served by the gateway itself through the Infinity datasource using RELATIVE urls, so no Loki is needed: the list calls GET /gateway/session_list?from=${__from}&to=${__to}, so it shows only the sessions active within the dashboard time range, and the detail panels call GET /gateway/session/{session_id}. Set the Infinity datasource Base URL to the gateway root (e.g. http://llm-gateway:8080) and add that host to Infinity > Security > Allowed hosts. A session is {metadata, messages, tools, turns}: messages and tools hold every unique value under its hash, turns list each exchange as the hashes the client sent (input) and the hash the model answered (output). The metadata durations (age_sec/idle_sec/expires_in_sec) are computed at read time.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Что это и как читать",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## ⚠️ Если везде «No Data»\n\nЭто **не значит**, что метрики не экспортируются. Сначала убедитесь, что выбран **правильный Data Source** в переменных дашборда (сверху) — без этого панели не найдут данные. После выбора нажмите Refresh.\n\n---\n\n## Как пользоваться\n\nПросмотр сохранённых сессий. В таблице «Stored sessions» найдите нужную сессию и впишите её `session_id` в переменную сверху. Ниже раскроются детали сессии: метаданные, уникальные сообщения и объявления инструментов (по хешу) и ходы — что прислал клиент (`input`) и чем ответила модель (`output`). Читаемый диалог удобнее смотреть через `misc/dump_session.py --transcript`.\n"
      },
      "transparent": false
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Stored sessions",
      "description": "Chat sessions persisted in Valkey that were active within the dashboard time range (created before its end and last updated after its start), newest activity first. Widen the time range to see older sessions. age_sec is the lifetime since the first request (from created_at); idle_sec is time since the last request; expires_in_sec is the remaining TTL (reset on every request). messages and tools count unique values, turns counts exchanges. Click a session id to load its full record below.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}"
          },
          "type": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "format": "table",
          "parser": "backend",
          "url": "/gateway/session_list?from=${__from}&to=${__to}",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "GET",
            "data": "",
            "body_type": "raw"
          },
          "root_selector": "",
          "filters": [],
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "session_id",
              "text": "session_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "updated_at",
              "text": "updated_at",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "age_sec",
              "text": "age",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "idle_sec",
              "text": "idle",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "expires_in_sec",
              "text": "expires_in",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "message_cnt",
              "text": "messages",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "tools_cnt",
              "text": "tools",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "turn_cnt",
              "text": "turns",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "left",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true,
            "inspect": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "session_id"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Open this session",
                    "url": "/d/gateway-session-viewer/gateway-session-viewer?var-session_id=${__value.raw}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 360
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "age|idle|expires_in"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "updated_at",
            "desc": true
          }
        ],
        "footer": {
